<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">Ezra</book>
  <para style="h">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezra</para>
  <para style="mt">Ezra</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia Kumpi Cyrus’ a maan kum khatna kumin, Jeremiah kam sung panin Topa’ thugen a tangtun thei nadingin ama’ gam sung zosie-ah Persia kumpipa Cyrus in tangko khat sawl a, a kumpi gam zosie-ah lai tawh a kigiel kumpipa thupieh tam banga a tangtawh nadingin Persia kumpi Cyrus’ lungsim Topa in a tham hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Persia kumpipa Cyrus in tam bangin gen hi: Vantung Pasien, Topa in leitung kumpi gam zosie kei ei pie zo ta a, Judah gama Jerusalem ah ama adingin biehinn khat a lampieh dingin kei ei sawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note lahah ama’ mi poma - a Pasien in amate ompi taheh! - tu-in Judah gam sunga Jerusalem ah peito-in Topa’ biehinn lamkia uheh- ama pen Jerusalem-a om Pasien ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a hingsun teng, heisung munah a teng zongun, a tenna mun vua mite in Jerusalem-a Pasien’ biehinn adingin nopthu-a biehnate banah, ngun le kham, nate le ganhingte tawh panpi ciet uheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah le Benjamin sunga innkuon lutangte, siempute le Levi-te Pasien’ hlagau in a lungsim uh a thamkhah mi zosie- Jerusalem khuo-a om Topa’ biehinn lamkia dingin kisa-in a kuonto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A veng a pamte zosie in a amau’ kizaw zaza a pieh ban vuah ngun tawh kibawl vanzahte, kham, nate, ganhing, le letsong manphate tawh amate a hu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in Jerusalem pana a na puohdawh, a pasien-te’ inn sunga a na koi ahi Topa’ biehinn vanzahte zong kumpi Cyrus in a lakhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Persia Kumpipa Cyrus in tuate pusuo-in sumkempa Mithredath khut sungah ap a, Methredath in a sum phaza simin Judah uhpa Sheshbazzar’ khut sungah ap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam teng pen van sazien ahi hi: Kham kuong sawmthum, ngun kuong tulkhat, nam sawmni le kuo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kham kuongkum sawmthum; adang ngun kuongkum zali le sawmkhat; vanzah adang tulkhat ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kham le ngun tawh a kibawl vanzah zosie a unpi-in tulnga zali sawmguh le kuo pha hi. Salte, Babylon panin Jerusalame ah a kipeipito ciengin Sheshbazzar in tuate zosie a peitopi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in mi tam teng pen Babylon Kumpi Nebuchadnezzar in a zawna gam panin Babylon ah sala a lahte sung panin Jerusalem le Judah gama peikiate ahi uhi; amate pen Jerusalem le Judah sung, amau’ khuopi cietah a kilekia ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Seraiah, Reelaiah, Mordecai, Bilshan, Mispar, Bigvai, Rehum, le Baanah-te tawh amate a zawhton uhi. Israel mite a phaza:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Parosh suonte, mi tulni le zakhat sawmsagi le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Shephatiah suonte, zathum sawmsagi le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Arah suonte, zasagi sawmsagi le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pahath-moab be sung panin Jeshua le Joab’ suonte, tulni zagiet sawm le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elam suonte, tulkhat zani sawmnga le li ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zattu suonte, zakuo sawmli le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zaccai suonte, zasagi sawmguh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bani suonte, zaguh sawmli le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bebai suonte, zaguh sawmni le thum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azgad suonte, tulkhat zani sawmni le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adonikam suonte, zaguh sawmguh le guh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bigvai suonte, tulni sawmnga le guh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Adin suonte, zali sawmnga le li ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ater a kici Hezekiah suonte, sawmkuo le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bezai suonte, zathum sawmni le thum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jorah suonte, zakhat sawm le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hashum suonte, zani sawmni le thum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gibbar suonte, sawmkuo le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bethlehem mite, zakhat sawmni le thum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Netophah-te, sawmnga le guh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anathoth-te, zakhat sawmni le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azmaveth-te, sawmli le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kiriatharim, Chephirah, Beeroth-te, zasagi sawmli le thum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ramah le Geba-te, zaguh sawmni le khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Michmash-te, zakhat sawmni le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bethel le Ai-te, zani sawmni le thum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nebo suonte, sawmnga le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Magbish-te, zakhat sawmnga le guh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Adang Elam suonte, tulkhat zani sawmnga le li ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Harim-te, zathum sawmni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lod, Hadid, le Ono-te, zasagi sawmni le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jericho-te, zathum sawmli le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Senaah-te, tulthum zaguh sawmthum ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Siempute: Jeshua-te be panin Jedaiah suonte, zakuo sawmsagi le thum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Immer suonte, tulkhat sawmnga le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pashhur suonte, tulkhat zani sawmli le sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Harim suonte, tulkhat sawm le sagi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Levi-te sung panin: Hodaviah-te be panin Jeshua suonte le Kadmiel suonte, sawmsagi le li ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lasate: Asaph suonte, zakhat sawmni le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kotcingte nam sung panin Shallum suonte, Ater suonte, Talmon suonte, Akkub suonte, a unpi-un zakhat sawmthum le kuo ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Biehinnpi nasamte: Ziga suonte, Hasupa suonte, Tabbaoth suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Keros suonte, Siaha suonte, Padon suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Lebanah suonte, Hagabah suonte, Akkub suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hagab suonte, Shamlai suonte, Hanan suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Giddel suonte, Gahar suonte, Reaiah suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Rezin, Nekoda, Gazzam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Uzza, Peseah, Besai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Asnah suonte, Meunim suonte, Nephisim suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Babuk suonte, Hakupha suonte, Harhur suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Bazluth suonte, Mehida suonte, Harsha suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Barkos suonte, Sisera suonte, Temah suonte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Neziah suonte, le Hatipha suonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Solomon’ nasemte suonlehlahte sung pan: Sotai, Hassophereth, Peruda,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Jaalah, Darkon, Giddel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Shephatiah, Hattil, Pochereth-hazzebaim, le Ami-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Biehinnpi nasemte zosie le Solomon’ nasemte’ suonlehlahte zosie a unpi-in zathum sawmkuo le ni pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tam a nei-a teng in a phung a tang uh kan thei loin, Israel mi ahile ahi lo uh theicien nawn sih nan ule, Tel-melah, Tel-harsha, Cherub, Addan, le Immer-te pana ang peito mite:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Delaiah suonte, Tobiah suonte, le Nekoda suonte, mi zaguh sawmnga le ni ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Siempute sung panin zong: Habaiah suonte, Hakkoz suonte, le Barzillai suonte (ama in Gilead mi Barzillai tanute khat zi-a a lah ziehin tua min tawh a kilo pah) ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tam mite in khang ciemtena laibu sungah a min uh a sui vangun a min uh a kimu sih a, tua ahi ziehin amate a sieng loin kiciemte a, siempu nasep kisemsah lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Urim le Thummim tawh ai san ding siempu khat a om masangsie amate in an siengtho pen a neh lo nading uh gam uhpa in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />A kikhawm buppi, tul sawmli le tulni le zathum a pha vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />amau’ nasem numei le pasal, mihing tulsagi le zathum sawmthum le sagite kisim lo hi; tuale amate in lasa numei le pasal zani a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Amate in sakol, zasagi sawmthum le guh, laa-sakol, zani sawmli le nga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />kalaoh, zali sawmthum le nga, le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />laa, tulguh zasagi le sawmni a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Amate in a neiza utawh kituohin biehinn lam nadingin kham darics tul sawmguh le tulkhat, ngun mina tulnga, le siempu puontuol zakhat a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Siempute, Levi-te, le mi pawlkhatte Jerusalem le a kim nai-ah a teng uhi; tuale lasate, kotcingte, biehinn nasemte, le Israel mi zosie a khuopi ciet vuah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A hla sagina a tun ciengin a khuopi te vuah Israel-te a teng vua, mite Jerusalem ah a kisutuo uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua ciengin Jozadak’ tapa Jeshua le a siempu seppite, Shealtiel’ tapa Zerubbabel le a sanggamte kipanin Pasien’ mi Moses’ thukham sunga a kigiel bangin meihal biehna dingin Israel Pasien’ maitam a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A veng vua teng mite a giin ziehun amate in a khuombul ma-ah maitam phutin zingmawng le nitahin Topa tungah meihal biehna a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in a kigielsa bangin buh pawi a bawl vua, ngaina kip a om dung zui-in nisima a kisam za bangin meihal biehnate nisimin a pie vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuale tatsat lo meihal biehnate a bawl zaw ciengun, amate in hla tha siela biehnate, le a siengtho Topa’ pawi zosiete le Topa tungah amau’ nopthu tawh a pie mi zosie’ biehnate a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a hla sagina a ni masa ni panin Topa tungah meihal biehna ding a kipan uhi. Ahi vangin Topa’ biehinnpi adingin khuombul a kiphut nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in suongkhengte le khutsiemte tungah sum pie-in Persia Kumpipa Cyrus tung pan a sum nga dan uh tawh kizui-in Lebanon panin tuipi gei Joppa ah taamtah singte a puohsuh nadingun Sidon-te le Tyre-te tungah anneh tuidawn le sathau a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem-a Pasien’ biehinn ah a tun zaw uh a kum nina, tua kum a hla nina sungin Shealtiel’ tapa Zerubbabel le Jozadak’ tapa Jeshua in a omlai amau’ mite, siempute, Levi-te, le saltanna pan Jerusalem a peikia-te zosie tawh nasep a kipan uhi. Amate in Levi-te, kum sawmni pan a tunglam sie poma Topa’ biehinn lam nasep van dingin a se uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale Jeshua a tapate le a tanaute tawh, Hodaviah-te’ sanggamte Kadmiel le a tapate, Binnui le Henadad a tapate tawh, Levi-te a tapate le a tanaute tawh kithuo-in Pasien’ biehinn nasemte vanton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Innlamte in Topa’ biehinnpi khuom bul a phu ciengun, Israel kumpipa David’ thupiehna tawh kizui-in Topa patawi dingin siempute in a puon uh silin pengkul tawh, Asaph’ tapa Levi-te daltuo tawh a panmun ding vuah a pang uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa phatna le lungdamkona a kidawngin a sa vua, “Bangzieh ahei cile Topa hoi a, Israel-te a itna kip tawntung hi,” a ci uhi. Topa’ biehinn khuombul kiphut zo ta ahi ziehin amate in Topa a phat ciengun mi zosie in a aw neiza utawh dawngin a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi tampite kipahin a kiko vangun a biehinn masa uh a mu ngai siempu tampite, Levi-te, le innkuon lutangte, tehsiete in tam biehinn a mu ciengun a gingin a kap uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuaci’n mite in lungdamna awging le kaana awging a khen thei sih uhi, bangzieh ahei cile a gingin mite a awng vua, a gamla panin tua awging a kiza hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saltanna pana a kilekia-te in Israel Pasien Topa’ biehinnpi lam uhi, ci thu Judah le Benjamin’ galte in a zah ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zerubbabel, Jeshua, le innkuon lutangte va nai-in amate kungah, “Kote tawh lamton bo vai, bangzieh ahei cile ko zong noma banga na Pasien uh a bie ka hi vua, tami muna ei peipi Assyria kumpipa Esar-haddon huna kipan ama kunga biehpiehna a pie ka ta bo uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Zerubbabel, Jeshua, le Israel sunga innkuon lutang a omlai teng in amate kungah, “Kote Pasien adingin biehinn ka lamna vuah note ei lamhu ding kisam lo hi; Persia Kumpipa Cyrus in ei thupieh bangin Israel Pasien Topa adingin ko guohin ka lam lel ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin a gam mite in Judah mite a lungkiesah vua, a inn lam ding uh a zausisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale amate in zong a gelnate uh a subuoi dingin uliente guhgol pie-in, Persia Kumpipa Cyrus hun sung tungtawn le Kumpi Darius hun dongin a subuoi den uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahasueras in kumpi a sep a kipat cil lai-in amate in Judah le Jerusalem-a tengte mawsahna lai khat a giel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale Persia Kumpi Artaxerxes hun sungin, Mishlam le Mithredath, Tabeel, le a omlai a kithuopi teng in Persia Kumpipa Artaxerxes tungah lai a hlah uhi; tua laihlah pen Aram lai tawh kigiel a, Aram ham ma tawh kilet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa’ khut nei-a om ulien Rehum le laigiel pa Shimshai in Kumpi Artaxerxes tungah Jerusalem a langpanna uh lai khat a nei-a bangin a giel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(tua ciengin kumpipa’ khut nei-a om ulien Rehum, laigiel Shimshai, le a kithuopi teng zosie, thukhente, palaite, uliente, Persia-te, Erech-te le Babylon-te, Elam-te a kici Susa mite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a lien mama le a zahtahhuoi Osnappar in a na nawkhiet, Samaria gama khuopite le Gungal gamkhen-a a tensah adangte in tua lai a giel vua - tuale tu-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tami pen amau’ laihlah a kiteisawn ahi hi): “Artaxerxes Kumpipa tungah: Gungal gamkhen-a om na nasemte in kang hopi uhi. Tuale tu-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nangma kung panin Jerusalem-a ko kunga ang pei Jews-te a pei zo ta uhi; amate in a gilo, mi ledo thei khuopi lamkia uhi. Amate in kulpi bawl a man kuon ta vua, khuo bulpite a puophat laitah uh ahi ci thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua khu kilamkia-in a kulpite hing kimansieng leh amate in sieh le kaih, vanlah man, le losapte ang pie nawn sih ding vua, kumpi phiengsie ang tawm tuom ding ci thu zong thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu-in kote ka hi uleh kumpi innpi sunga an nengkie tawh a kivah ka hi bo ziehun, kumpipa’ vangta lam a mu dingin zong ka kilawm valia sih uhi. Tua ahi ziehin na pu na pate’ thuciemtena laibute a kisuikia thei nadingin kumpipa kungah mi sawlin kang zasah uhi. Tua thuciemtena laibute en lacin tam khuopi pen tanglai panin a ledo khuopi, kumpite le gamkhente a gimsah, a khuo sunga kumpi do dingin a kikuontawna thu na mu ding hi. Tam khuopi a kisuhsietna zong tam thu hang ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam khuopi hing kilamkia hinlen a kulpite ang kizo sieng mawh leh Gungal gamkhen teng pen nangma’ tanh ahi nawn lo nading thu, kumpipa kungah kang theisah uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa in tam bangin lai thuhkia hi: “Kumpipa khut nei-a om ulien Rehum, laigiel Shimshai le Samaria gama tengte le Gungal gamkhen tenga a teng na kithuopite zosie tungah kang hopi uhi. Tu-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kei tunga nei laihlah uh pen kiletin ka mai-ah kicientahin kisim zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in thupieh khat bawlin mi pawlkhat ka kansah a, tami khuopi pen tanglai-a kipanin kumpite langpangin, tami khuo sungah ledona le kumpi dona a om zing lamtah kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jerusalem in a thahat kumpite a na nei ngai vua, Gungal gamkhen buppi tungah na vaihawmin, amate tungah sieh le kaih, vanlah man, le losapte na kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tam mite a nasep a khawl nadingun thupieh khat na bawl un. Keima in thupieh khat kang bawlkia masangsie tami khuopi kilamkia lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua tham loin, tami tungtang nasep ding don loin na mawh om lo nadingun kidawm un; bang dingin kumpipa sup nadingin sietna khang ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa khut nei-a om ulien Rehum, laigiel Shimshai, le a kithuopi teng mai-a a kiteisawn Kumpi Artaxerxes’ laihlah a kisim ciengin, Jerusalem-a Jews-te kungah va nawpei-in thagum hatna le thuneina suongin a nasep uh a khawlsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khum huna kipanin Jerusalem-a Pasien’ biehinn lam nasep khawl a, Persia Kumpipa Darius’ maan a kum nina dongin innlam nasep kizom nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in kamsangpa Haggai le Iddo’ tapa Zechariah-te in Judah le Jerusalem-a om Jews-te tungah Israel Pasien’ minin kam a sang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Shealtiel’ tapa Zerubabbel le Jozadak’ tapa Jeshua in Jerusalem ah Pasien’ biehinn lamkia ding a kipan uhi; tuale amate tawh Pasien’ kamsangte a omton vua, amate a hu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin amate kungah Gungal gamkhen uhpa Tattenai, Shethar-bozenai, le ama’ kithuopite pei-in amate kungah, “Tami biehinn na lam nading ule a khuom a zawlte hlungin na man sieng nading uh koi hing thupieh ahiei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in amate kungah, “Tami inn lamte’ min koi teng ahei?” ci zong a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanle a Pasien uh’ mit in Jews upate vil gige a, Darius kungah tam thu va tungin ama kung pan lai tawh thuhkiana a kilekia masangsie, amate in a nasep uh a khawlsah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gungal gamkhen uhpa Tattenai, Shethar-bozenai, le Gungal gamkhente-a a om ama’ kithuopi palai teng in Kumpi Darius tungah a kiteisawn laihlah khat a hlah uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />amate in a hlah uh thuzahsahna lai tam banga kigiel ahi hi: “Darius kumpipa tungah thupha namcin hing tung taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah gama a lien mama Pasien’ biehinn-a ka va hawna uh kumpipa kungah kang theisah uhi. Tami biehinn pen suong kikhengzolsa tawh kilam ahi a, a kawmte sing tawh kibawl ahi hi. Amau’ khut sungah tami nasep limtahin a kisem a, masot toto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin upate tawh ka kiho vua, amate kungah, ‘Note in tami biehinn na lam nading ule tami a khuom a zawlte hlungin na man sieng nading uh koi hing thu pieh ahiei?’ ci-in ka dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na thei dingin a minte uzong ka dong vua, a makaite’ min zong ka giel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amau’ ei dawnna tam bang teng ahi hi: ‘Ko pen van le lei Pasien’ nasemte ka hi vua, kum sawtpi lai-a Israel’ kumpi lien khat in a na lamsa a lamkia ka hi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle ka pu ka pate un vantung Pasien a lungthahsah ziehun Babylon Kumpipa, Chaldea-te Nebuchadnezzar’ khut sungah amate a na pieh lai-in, tami biehinn zong a na suhsiet ahi a, a mite zong Babylon gama a na peipi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanle Babylon Kumpipa Cyrus in a uh a kum khatna kumin tami Pasien’ biehinn lamkia nading thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua tham loin, Nebuchadnezzar in Jerusalem biehinnpi sung pana a na lah, Babylon biehinnpi sunga a na koi ahi Pasien’ biehinn sunga a om ngaisa kham le ngun tawh a kibawl vanzah teng Kumpi Cyrus in Babylon biehinnpi panin la-in ama in tua teng pen gam uhpa dinga a koi Sheshbazzar a kici mipa kungah ap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama kungah, “Tami vanzah teng peipi inlen, Jerusalem biehinnpi sungah va koikia ta’n. Ama’ mun ngai ma-ah Pasien’ biehinnpi lamsahkia in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Sheshbazzar pei-in Jerusalem ah Pasien’ biehinn bulpite a phut hi; tuale khum huna kipanin tudong kilamin kizo nai lo hi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale tu-in kumpipa in pha na sah leh, Jerusalem biehinn lamkia nading thu kumpipa Cyrus in thu a pie tahpi amah, pie lo ahei ci thu tawh kisai-in Babylon khuo sunga kikoi kumpite’ thuciemtena laibu sungah suisah in. Kumpipa in tam thu tawh kisai-in na lunglam bang ahi ei mah ci ei zasahkia in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Darius in khensatna thukip khat bawl a, amate in Babylon khuo sunga kumpi lai thupite kikoina innte a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin Media gamkhen kumpi khuopi Ekbatana ah laiziel khat kimu a, tua sungah tam bangin kigiel hi: “A kiciemtena.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kumpi sep a kum khatna kumin Kumpipa Cyrus in tam bangin thukip lai khat na hawm hi: Jerusalem-a Pasien’ biehinn tawh kisai-in biehpiehnate a kibawlna le meihal biehnate a kipeipina munah biehinn lamsahkia unlen, a sanna tong sawmguh, avai tong sawmguh ma hi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a kawm pen a kikhengzol suongtum guol thum le sing guol khat tawh kicieng ding hi; sum a tawp zaza kumpi sumkholna panin kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua banah Nebuchadnezzar in Jerusalem biehinnpi pana a lah, Babylon khuo-a a peipi Pasien’ biehinn sunga a om kham le ngun tawh kibawl vanzahte lasahkia unlen, Jerusalem biehinnpi sungah kipiekia ding a, amau’ om ngaina cietah tuate kikoikia ding hi; note in Pasien’ inn sungah tuate na koiding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tu-in Gungal gamkhen a uhpa Tattenai, Shethar-bozenai le nang, amau’ kithuopi Gungal gam palaite na hemkhie unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tami Pasien’ biehinn lam nasep ama le ama omsah lel un; Jews-te gam uhpa le a upate in a mun lui ma-ah tami Pasien’ biehinn lamsahkia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua tham loin tami Pasien’ biehinnpi a kilamkia thei nadingin note in tami Judah upate adingin bang bawlpieh ding na hi uh hei ci thu tawh kisai-in keima in tam bangin thukip khat ka bawl hi. A tawp zosie Gungal gamkhen pana kinga sieh le kaihte ahi kumpi phiengsieh kikhonte panin zekai loin a cingtahin kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kisam poma-van Pasien tungah meihal biehna-a pieh dingin bawngtang a note, tuutangte, ahi sihle tuunote na pie ding vua, Jerusalem-a siempute’ ang ngetna bangin amate tungah nisielin mangbu, ci, lenggazu, ahi sihle sathaute na piesah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in van Pasien tungah lungdamna biehpiehnate bawlin kumpipa le a tapate’ hinkhuo adingin thumpieh thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua banah mi khatpo in tami thupiehna a khel leh tua a khiel mi pa’ inn panin zawlpi khat kibot ding a, tua ciengin tua zawl tungah ama kikhai-in kisunlia ding a, ama’ inn pen bawng-eeh kholna-in kinei ding hi, ci-in thukip ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami ka thupieh a khel nuom, ahi sihle Jerusalem-a Pasien’ biehinn a susie nuom kumpi khatpo ahi a, mi khatpo ahi zongin a op leh, ama’ min om na dinga tua mun a bawl Pasien in tua mipa thalpai taheh. Keima Darius in thukip kang pie hi; tua khu kukaltaha sep ding ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Darius in a vaihlah kammal tawh kizui-in Gungal gamkhen uhpa Tattenai, Shethar-bonezai, le amau’ kithuopite in kukal tahin Kumpi Darius’ thupieh a sem pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n kamsangpa Haggai le Iddo’ tapa Zechariah-te’ kamsanna tungtawnin Jews upate in biehinn lamin a masot mama uhi. Amate in Israel Pasien’ thupiehna le Cyrus, Darius le Kumpi Artaxerxes-te’ thupiehna tawh biehinn lam a zo sieng uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuale Kumpi Darius in kumpi a sep zaw a kum guhna, Adar hla a ni thum ni-in tami biehinn lam nasep kiman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mite, siempute, Levi-te, le ang kinuale saltang a omlai teng in lungdam tahin tami Pasien’ biehinn apna pawi a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tami Pasien’ biehinnpi apna-ah bawngtang zakhat, tuutang zani, le tuuno zali biehna-in a go vua, a minam phaza tawh kizui-in Israel zosie’ mawna zieha biehna adingin keeltang sawm le ni a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Moses’ laibu sunga kigielsa bangin Jerusalem-a nasem dingin siempute le Levi-te a khen khenin a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hla masa a ni sawm le li ni-in saltanna pana ang kinuale mite in peisan pawi a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azieh pen siempute le Levi-te kisiensuo ton uhi; amate a unpi-un a siengtho a hi ta uhi. Tuaci’n saltang ang kilekia zosie ading, a siempu septonpite ading, le amate adingin peisan tuuno a go uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saltanna pana ang kilekia Israel mite le Israel Pasien Topa bie dingin tua gam sung minamte le a buana pan vua a kikhenkhie, amate ang pawl mi zosie in tua an a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in lungdam kipahin ni sagi sung tol saw lo anlum pawi a bawl uhi; azieh pen Topa in amate lungnuomsah a, tuale Assyria kumpipa’ lungsim amate lamah a kiheisah hi, tuaci’n ama in Israel Pasien’ biehinn a lamna vuah amate a panpi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam zaw ciengin Persia Kumpipa Artaxerxes a maan hun sungin Seraiah’ tapa Ezra, Azariah’ tapa Seraiah, Hilkiah’ tapa Azaraiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Shalum’ tapa Hilkiah, Zadok’ tapa Shallum, Ahitub’ tapa Zadok,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amariah’ tapa Ahitub, Azariah’ tapa Amariah, Meraioth’ tapa Azariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zerahiah’ Meraioth, Uzzi’ tapa Zerahiah, Bukki’ tapa Uzzi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abishua’ tapa Bukki, Phinehas’ tapa Abishua, Eleazar’ tapa Phinehas, siempupi pa Aaron-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tami Ezra pen Babylon pana ang tungto ahi hi. Ama pen Israel Pasien Topa in a piehsa Moses’ thukham a siem laithei mi khat ahi hi; tuale ama tungah Topa a Pasien khut a op ziehin a nget zosie kumpipa in a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpi Artaxerxes in a uh zaw a kum sagina kumin Israel mi pawlkhat, le siempute, Levi-te, lasate, kotcingte, le biehinn nasemte pawlkhat zong, Jerusalem ah a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa in a uh kum sagi a cin kum, a hla ngana sungin Jerusalem ah amate a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama tunga a hepi siem a Pasien’ khut a op ziehin, a hla masa a ni khat ni-in Babylon panin khuolzin kipan a, a hla ngana a ni khat ni-in Jerusalem ah a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Ezra in a lungtang sungah Topa’ thukham kanin tuate zui ding le Israel gam sungah thukhamte le ngaina kipte hil a sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami pen Kumpi Artaxerxes in siempu, laithei pa, Israel adinga Topa’ thupiehnate le a thukham a siem ahi mipil Ezra tunga a pieh a kiteisawn laihlah ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kumpite’ kumpipa Artaxerxes tung panin van Pasien’ thukham a siem, siempu laithei Ezra tungah a kigiel khu tam bang ahi hi: Kilemna. Tuale tu-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />keima in ka gam sunga a om Israel mite khatpo ahi a, a siempute ahi a, Levi-te ahi zongin, Jerusalem-a pei nuom a op leh nang tawh zawhton dingin thukhentatna a kip ka bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile na khut sunga a om na Pasien’ thukham dung zui-in Judah le Jerusalem thu a kan dingin kumpipa le a thu kuppi mihing sagite in nang ang sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note pen a tenna uh Jerusalem ahi kumpipa le a thu kikuppite in Israel Pasien tungah kiphal taha a piehsa uh ngun le khamte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Babylon gam bup-a na mu ding uh ngun le kham zosie, mite le a siempute in Jerusalem ah a Pasien uh’ biehinn dinga lungkimtaha a pieh uh amau’ nop thu-a a kipie biehnate tawh zong a va puohton ding na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin tami sum tawh pilvang tahin bawngtangte, tuutangte, tuunote, an tawh a biehnate ule dawnthei a biehnate na lei ding vua, Jerusalem-a na Pasien uh’ biehinn sunga maitam tungah tuate na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngun le kham a val teng na Pasien uh’ deina tawh kituohin na guolhaw tawh hoi na sah bangun na zang thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na Pasien uh’ biehinn sunga zah dinga ang kipie vanzahte, Jerusalem Pasien mai-ah na tut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang in pieh dinga mawpuohna na nei na Pasien biehinn dinga a kisam adang khat popo, kumpipa’ sumkholna panin na pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Keima, Kumpi Artaxerxes in Gungal gam sunga om sumkem zosie kungah tam bangin thu ka pie hi: Vantung Pasien Pa’ thukham lam a siem laithei, siempu Ezra in na tung vua ang nget poma,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ngun talent zakhat, mangbu cor zakhat, lenggazu bath zakhat, sathau bath zakhat, le ci a dei zaza na pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vantung Pasien’ thupieh popo, vantung Pasien’ biehinn adingin pawnthaw tahin kibawl ding hi. Tua ahi sihle kumpipa gamsung le a tapate tungah lungthahna ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Siempute, Levi-te, lasate, kotcingte, biehinn nasemte, ahi sihle tami Pasien’ biehinn sunga nasemte khat popo tung panin sieh le kaih ahi a, vanlah man ahi a, losap ahi zongin lah ding thu na nei lona uzong kang zasah hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tua hi a, nang Ezra in na nei dinga ang kipie Pasien’ pilna tawh kizui-in, Gungal gam sunga a om na Pasien’ thukhamte a thei mi zosie tunga thu khen dingin ulien vaihawmte le thukhente koi in. Nang in Pasien’ thukham a thei lote na hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na Pasien’ thukham le kumpipa’ thukham a mang lo poma, sina ahi a, hawlkhietna ahi a, a neisate uh lahpiehna ahi a, thongkhiehna ahi zongin, khautahin thu kikhen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem-a om Topa’ biehinn a thupi suo thei nadinga kumpipa’ lungtang sungah tam banga nate a guonpieh pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />kumpipa le a thu kuppite, le kumpipa’ mi thahat uliente mai-a itna kip tawh ei it, i pu i pate’ Pasien, Topa in thupha nga taheh. Keima tungah Topa ka Pasien’ khut ang op ziehin tha ka nga a, kei tawh a peito dingin Israel panin makaite ka khawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Artaxerxes a maan hun sungin Babylon pana ka peitopi innkuon lutangte le a khangsimna uh tam bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phinehas suonte pan Gershom ahi hi. Ithamar suonte pan Daniel ahi hi. David suonte pan Hattush,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Shecaniah suonte pan Parosh-te Zechariah le ama tawh pasal zakhat le sawmnga a min kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pahath-moab suonte pan Zerahiah’ tapa Elihoenai le ama tawh pasal zani ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zattu suonte pan Jahaziel’ tapa Shecaniah, le ama tawh pasal zathum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Adin suonte pan Jonathan’ tapa Ebed, le ama tawh pasal sawmnga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elam-te suon pan Athaliah’ tapa Jeshaiah, ama tawh pasal sawm sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Shephatiah suonte pan Michael’ tapa Zebadaih, le ama tawh pasal sawmgiet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab suonte pan Jehiel’ tapa Obadiah, le ama tawh pasal zani le sawm le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bani suonte pan Josiphiah’ tapa Shelomit, le ama tawh pasal za le sawmguh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bebai suonte pan Bebai’ tapa Zechariah, le ama tawh pasal sawmni le giet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azgad suonte pan Hakkatan’ tapa Johanan, le ama tawh pasal za le sawmkhat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adonikam suonte pan ang nuapeite, a min uh Eliphelet, Jeuel, le Shemaiah le ama tawh pasal sawmguh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bigvai suonte Uthai le Zaccur amate tawh pasal sawm sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in Ahava gam lama a luong lui gei khatah amate ka khawmtuo a, khum sungah ni thum sung phuol ka sat uhi. Mite le siempute ka etphat ciengin tua munah Levi’ suonte khat zong ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in Eliezer, Ariel, Shemaiah, Elnathan, Jarib, Elnathan, Nathan, Zechariah, le Meshullam-te, le mipil Joiarib le Elnathan-te ka hlansah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Casiphia a kici muna a makaipa Iddo kungah amate va pei-in Iddo kung le Casiphia-a a septonpi uh biehinn nasemte kungah i Pasien uh’ biehinn sungah nasem ding mi ang puoh nadingun a gen dingin amate ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hepina a nei i Pasien in ei ompi ahi ziehin Levi-te Mahli suonte panin thu ngaisut a siem Sherebiah, a tate le a hieng a sante tawh pasal sawm le giet;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />le Merari suonte pan Jesaiah, a hieng a sante le a tate mi sawm le ni le Hashabiah tawh zong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tua banah David le ama’ uliente in Levi-te’ na sem dinga a tuomkoi uh biehinn nasem zani le sawmni ang puoh uhi. Amate a unpi-un a min ciet utawh kihlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin eite’ Pasien mai-ah ko le ko kingielin, ko le ka naupangte ule ka neisa zosie uh dam le bitin ama tungah khuolzinna khat ka nei thei nading vua ka nget thei nadingun keima in Ahava lui-ah antan nading thu ka tangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kumpipa kungah ka Pasien un ama a suite zosie hepi a, a hi vangin ama a nuasie zosiete tungah a zauhuoi a lungthahna tungsah hi, ka na cisa uh ahi ziehin lampi-ah kote ei hun dingin galkapte le sakol galkapte ama kunga ka nget ding ka mai a zum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka Pasien uh tungah tami adingin antangin ka ngen vua, ama in ka thum ka tauna uh ei ngaipieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin a makai siempute sawm le ni ka tuomkoi hi: Sherebiah, Hashabiah, le amate tawh a hieng a san uh mi sawm ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuale keima in i Pasien uh’ inn dinga kumpipa le a thu kuppite, a tote ule tua muna om Israel mi zosie in a pieh ngun le kham le vanzahte, amate adingin ka tepieh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />keima in a khut sung vuah ngun talent zaguh le sawmnga, le ngun tawh kibawl vanzahte zakhat man ... talent-te, le kham talent zakhat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />darics tulkhat man kham kuongkum sawmni, le kham banga a manpha a kitaival sumsan hoi tawh kibawl beel ni ka tepieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuale keima in amate kungah, “Note Topa adingin na siengtho vua, vanzahte zong a siengtho hi; tuale ngun le khamte khu na pu na pate uh’ Pasien ahi Topa tunga kipie nopthu-a biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jerusalem-a om Topa’ biehinn dan sunga siempu liente, Levi-te, le Israel innkuon lutangte mai-ah na tepieh masangsie uh tuate vilin kemcing un,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n siempute le Levi-te in Jerusalem-a om i Pasien’ biehinn sunga puoh dinga a kitesa ngun le kham le vanzahte a sang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jerusalem zuon dingin hla masa a ni sawm le ni ni-in Ahava gun panin ka dingkhie uhi; ka Pasien un ei na panpi a, lam kalah galte le ei na buhdap a tuomtuomte’ khut sung panin ei na hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah ka tung vua, tua munah ni thum sung ka taam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A ni li ni-in ka Pasien uh’ inn sunga Uriah’ tapa siempu Meremoth khut sungah ngun le kham, le vanzahte kite a, tuale ama tawh Phinehas’ tapa Eleazar a om vua, ama gel tawh Levi-te Jeshua’ tapa Jozabad le Binnui’ tapa Noadiah zong a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A unpi-in kisimin kite a, tua na zosie’ a gihna kiciemte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin saltanna pana ang kilekiate in Israel zosie ading Israel’ Pasien tungah meihal biehna dingin bawngtang sawm le ni, tuutang sawmkuo le guh, tuuno sawmsagi le sagi, le mawna zieha biehna dingin keeltang sawm le ni a pie uhi; tam teng zosie pen Topa kunga kipie meihal biehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate in Gungal gam a uhte le kumpipa’ khut nei-a thunei vaihawmte tungah kumpipa sawlnate a gen uhi; tuale amate in mite le Pasien’ biehinn lam nasep a hu uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam thu teng a kisep zaw ciengin uliente in keima kungah ei nai vua, “Israel mite, siempute, le Levi-te in khum gama mipi kidah ahi Canaan-te, Hit-te, Perez-te, Jebus-te, Ammon-te, Moab-te, Egypt-te, le Amor-te kung panin amau le amau a kituomkoih sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen amahaw’ tanute pawlkhat amate ding le a tapate vua dingin zi-in a la vua, tua bangin a siengtho cihlahte pen tua gam sung mite tawh a kisisawhal ta vua, tami citah lona-ah uliente le lamkaite makai ahi hi,” ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tami thu ka zah bepin ka puonte balkehin ka sam le ka khamul ka bot a, ci ding mel thei loin ka mawh to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin saltang kilekiate’ citah lona ziehin Israel Pasien’ thugen a zau-in a citun zosie keima kungah ang kikhawm vua, nitah biehpiehna hun dongin ci nading mel thei loin ka mawh to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nitah biehpieh hunin ka antanna pana ka sil ka puontuol kibalkeh kawm pi-in tho-in ka khupdin a, Topa Pasien lamah ka khut ka zah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuale, “Ka Pasien aw, ka khielnate uh ka lu uh sangin sang zaw a, ka mawnate un vantung dong banto ta ahi ziehin ka zum sengin kang mai ngat ngam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate uh’ khanga patin tuni dong ka khielna uh lien mama hi. Ka khielnate ziehun gamdang kumpite’ khut sungah kote, ka kumpite ule ka siempute uh kipie-in, namsau tawh sina, saltanna, neisa kisutna, le maizumna ci bangin ka na thuoh vua, tu dongin ka tuaci lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu bano khat sungin Topa ka Pasien un kote ei angvan a, a suohta pawlkhat ei omsahin ama in ka mit uh ei vahsah a, ka saltanna vuah husanna themno khat ei pieh thei nadingin a mun siengtho sungah pansia det khat ei pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen kote sila ka hi vua, hinanle ka saltanna vuah ka Pasien un ei nuasie loin ka Pasien uh’ biehinn a dinkia nading, a kisie teng a kipuophat nading, Judah le Jerusalem ah kulpite ei pieh thei nading, le hinkhuo tha ei pieh thei nadingin ama in Persia kumpite’ mai-ah a itna kip ei pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tuale tu-in kote’ Pasien aw, tam zaw ciengin bang gen nawn ding uh ka hei? Bangzieh ahei cile na thupiehnate ka taisan ta vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />na nasem kamsangte tungtawnin kote kungah, ‘Na luo ding vua na va lut nading uh gam pen a gam mite in a kidahhuoi amau’ gamtatna tawh a buasah uh a sieng lo gam ahi hi. A gam sung uh mong khat pan mong khat dongin amau’ sientho lona tawh a kidimsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a tanute ule na tapate uh kinungsah sih unlen, na tapate’ uh zi dingin a tanute la sih un. A nopsahna ding uh hile, a maavan nading uh hile hasui pieh sih un. Tua bang hi leh thahatin tua gam sunga a piengte na ne ding vua, kum tawna na tate uh’ luo dingin tua gam na nuasie pieh thei ding uhi,’ ci-a nei thupiehnate ka zui sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka sil hoilo bawlte ule a lien mama ka khielnate uh ziehin tam bang gimna zosie ka tung vua ang tun zaw ciengin, ka Pasien un ka thuoh ding vua a kilawm kohaw’ mawna paat sanga a tawmzaw gimna nei thuohsah a, a suohta le a omlai teng tam bangin themkhatin nei koi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />na thupiehnate kote in palsatkia-in, tami a kidahhuoi nate a bawl mite tawh kiteng kipikia ding ka hi uh amah? A omlai le a suohta koima a op nawn lo dongin ka tung vuah nang hing lungthahin ei susie lo ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel Pasien, Topa aw, nang khu na thutang a, ahi vangin tu-a bangin a suohta a omlai dingin kote nei bawl hi. Tami ziehin koima in nang ang maingat ngam lo vangin na mai-ah ka khielna pi ma utawh kang ding uhi,” ci-in thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ezra in Pasien’ biehinn mai-ah thu ngen a, a mawna pulahin kap le mau-in tuolah a kilawmlia laitahin, ama kungah Israel panin numei, pasal, naupang tampitah a kikhawm vua, nahpitahin mite a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elam suonte panin Jehiel’ tapa Shecaniah kungah, “Eite in i Pasien uh i um nawn sih vua, gam sunga a teng gamdang numeite tawh i kinung zo uhi. Hinanle tu nangawnin Israel adingin kinepna a om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n tu-in, ka pu uh nangma’ ngaisutna le i Pasien’ thupiehna a zatah mite’ ngaisutna bangin tami zite le a tate uh i peisah nadingin i Pasien utawh thuciemna khat bawl va vui; tuale thukham tawh kituohin sem va vui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kipan pai in, bangzieh ahei cile tam pen nang nasep ahi hi, nang kang ompi ding uhi; hang inlen sem in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ezra dingin a kigensa banga a gamtat nadingun siempu makaite, Levi-te, le Israel zosie a sawl hi. Tuaci’n amate a kiciem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien’ biehinn mai panin Ezra kihemkhie a, tuale Eliashib’ tapa Jehohanan inndan sungah pei-in a gieh hi. Saltangte’ tahtai lona ziehin an ne lo tui dawn loin da le mau-in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a kinuale saltangte zosie Jerusalem ah a kikhop thei nadingun Judah le Jerusalem mun zosie-ah tangtawhna khat a bawl vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ni thum sunga a tung lo khatpo a op leh uliente le upate’ thupieh dung zui-in a neisa zosie uh kiman ding a, amate mama in saltang mihonte lah panin hawlkhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah le Benjamin mi zosie ni thum sungin Jerusalem ah a kituo uhi; tua khu a hla kuona a ni sawmni ni ahi hi. Guo a hazuh seng zieh le tami thu ziehin mi zosie citunin Pasien’ biehinn mai leituolah a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu Ezra dingto-in amate kungah, “Note na tawnkhiel vua, gamdang numeite zi-in la-in Israel’ khielna na khangsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh’ Pasien ahi Topa tungah tu-in na mawnate uh pulah unlen, ama’ dei bangin bawl un; tam gama a teng gamdang mite le gamdang mi ahi na zite utawh kikhenin tuom om ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kikhawm mi zosie kiko-in a dawng vua, “A hima hi; na gen bangin ka bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi tampi i hi vua, guo tam hun zong ahi hi; kote a pulamah ka ding zo nawn sih uhi. Tami thu-ah eite tampi na tawnkhiel zo i hi ziehin tami nasep pen ni khat, ahi sihle ni ni sunga kizo thei ding thu ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kikhawm mihon bup ai-in ka uliente uh semsah in. Tami thu ziehin eite tung panin Pasien’ lungthahna a kihei dawh masangsie, i khuopi zosie-a om gamdang numeite tawh a kinung mi zosie in a khuo sung upate le thukhente ciet tawh a kise hunin i makaite kungah va pei ta uheh,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asahiel’ tapa Jonathan le Tikvah’ tapa Jahzeiah beh in tami thu nielin Meshullam le Levi-te Shabbethai in panpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin saltang a kilekiate in a kigensa bangin a bawl uhi. Siempu Ezra in a innkuon utawh kizui-in a innkuon lutangte uh sung panin pasalte a teng vua, amau’ min ciet tawh kiciemte hi. A hla sawmna a ni khat ni-in tua thu a kantel dingin amate a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hla masa a ni khat ni-in gamdang zi nei pasal zosie’ thu a kan uh a zo sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siempute suon panin Jozadak’ tapa Jeshua suonte le a sanggamte’ suonte sung panin gamdang numeite tawh a kinung tam teng kimu hi: Maaseiah, Eliezer, Jarib, le Gedaliah-te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A zite uh khul dingin amau le amau a kikamciem vua, a khielna zieh vua biehna dingin tuuhon lahah tuutang khat a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Immer suonte sung panin Hanani le Zebadiah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Harim suonte sung panin Maaseiah, Elijah, Shemaiah, Jehiel, le Uzziah-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pashhur suonte sung panin Elioenai, Maaseiah, Ishmael, Nethanel, Jozabad le Elasah-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Levi-te sung panin Jozabad, Shimei, Kelaiah (Kelita a kici), Pethahiah, Judah, le Eliezer-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lasate sung panin Eliashib ahi uhi. Kotcingte sung panin Shallum, Telem, le Uri-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel-te sung Parosh suonte panin Ramiah, Izziah, Malchijah, Mijamin, Eleazar, Hashabiah, le Benaiah-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Elam suonte panin Mattaniah, Zechariah, Jehiel, Abdi, Jeremoth, le Elijah-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zattu suonte sung panin Elioenai, Eliashib, Mattaniah, Jeremoth, Zabad, le Aziza-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bebai suonte sung panin Jehohanan, Hananiah, Zabbai, le Athlai-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bani suonte panin Meshullam, Malluch, Adaiah, Jashub, Sheal, le Jeremoth-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pahath-moab suonte sung panin Adna, Chelal, Benaiah, Maaseiah, Mattaniah, Bezalel, Binnui, le Manasseh-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Harim suonte panin Eliezer, Isshijah, Malchijah, Shemaiah, Shimeon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Benjamnin, Malluch, le Shemariah-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hashum suonte panin Mattenai, Mattattah, Zabad, Eliphelet, Jeremai, Manasseh, le Shimei-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bani suonte sung panin Maadai, Amtam, Uel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Benaiah, Bedeiah, Cheluhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Vaniah, Meremoth, Eliashib,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mattaniah, Mattenai, le Jaasu-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Binnui suonte sung panin Shimei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Shelemiah, Nathan, Adaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Machnadebai, Shashai, Sharai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Azarel, Shelemiah, Shemariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Shallum, Amariah, le Joseph-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nebo suonte sung panin Jeiel, Mattithiah, Zabad, Zebina, Jaddai, Joel, le Benaiah-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tam teng zosie gamdang zi nei ahi vua, tuaci’n amate in a zite uh a tate utawh a khultha uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
